<title>USA: Panatech shareholders approve merger.</title>
<headline>Panatech shareholders approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Panatech Research and Development Corp on Wednesday said its shareholders approved its merger with Titan Enterprises Inc at a special meeting.</p>
<p>Under the deal, each Panatech shareholder will receive $7 per share in cash for each share held. Each holder of Pantech Class B warrants will receive $2 per warrant.</p>
<p>The total value of the deal is about $34.6 million.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the merger &quot;will be consummated in the immediate future.&quot;</p>
<p>Panatech makes accessories for high-pressure paint spraying equipment.</p>
</text>
